h Principal Weems, but that's just the start of her problems. To fight an ancient evil, she'll need all her friends’ help.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3b42P1FuxWC9JXVIfnKAUUuq0zP.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIyL1dlZG5lc2RheS0lMjgyMDIyLSUyOS8.2.1","title":"Here We Woe Again","season":2,"episode":1,"released":"2025-08-06T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"After a productive summer break, Wednesday returns to Nevermore as a grudging campus celebrity — and the target of a dangerous stalker.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1L5TJquVHoCp19w5tKy48DfcCnZ.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIyL1dlZG5lc2RheS0lMjgyMDIyLSUyOS8.2.2","title":"The Devil You Woe","season":2,"episode":2,"released":"2025-08-06T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Chaos reigns on campus as Nevermore celebrates its annual Prank Day. Wednesday confronts an old enemy and gains an unwanted ally.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k5g6TAHMpXC8o85OZAOW2rfEWcG.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIyL1dlZG5lc2RheS0lMjgyMDIyLSUyOS8.2.3","title":"Call of the Woe","season":2,"episode":3,"released":"2025-08-06T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Stripped of both her ability and Goody's book, Wednesday is forced to do some old-fashioned detective work on a school camping trip.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/75n29ly38Sx4XNqXHkIRLpUcIfm.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIyL1dlZG5lc2RheS0lMjgyMDIyLSUyOS8.2.4","title":"If These Woes Could Talk","season":2,"episode":4,"released":"2025-08-06T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"It's an Addams family investigation as Fester and Thing commit themselves to Wednesday's case. Trying to conceal one secret, Bianca stumbles on another.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/irw76zkymiXrrAyC1ftq8Jomsuh.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIyL1dlZG5lc2RheS0lMjgyMDIyLSUyOS8.2.5","title":"Hyde and Woe Seek","season":2,"episode":5,"released":"2025-09-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"With Tyler on the loose, Wednesday readies for a risky Día de los Muertos showdown. Slurp's growing hunger poses problems for Pugsley.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7ophg7pjLtQhLsLiD46aTTAnpbY.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIyL1dlZG5lc2RheS0lMjgyMDIyLSUyOS8.2.6","title":"Woe Thyself","season":2,"episode":6,"released":"2025-09-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"An encounter with a spirit from Nevermore's past gives Wednesday and Enid a new perspective on one another — and puts one of their classmates in danger.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dXZnTHnv0wHwFWfTqfhs5A0z7ZO.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIyL1dlZG5lc2RheS0lMjgyMDIyLSUyOS8.2.7","title":"Woe Me the Money","season":2,"episode":7,"released":"2025-09-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"As the school gala looms, Wednesday digs up dirt on Dort, Enid tries not to wolf out and Morticia engages in a battle of wills with Grandmama.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eDtRN5bifoC2Zur9pjYQpSuqzWM.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIyL1dlZG5lc2RheS0lMjgyMDIyLSUyOS8.2.8","title":"This Means Woe","season":2,"episode":8,"released":"2025-09-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"When buried family secrets are unearthed, Wednesday must race against time to prevent a dark prophecy from being realized.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eqCAySjP9dXS4xgtbVAx1UjEi7D.jpg"}]}}